#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:7
#: 4899bf31a58b4c01a9929c522ad671ac
msgid "`Zubax GNSS 2 <https://zubax.com/products/gnss_2>`__ is a high-performance positioning module for outdoor environments with doubly redundant `DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org>`__ bus interface. It includes a state-of-the-art GPS/GLONASS receiver, a high-precision barometer and a 3-axis compass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:15
